user.description:
Open this URL in your browser and log in (SSO and MFA are supported):

{auth_url}

After logging in, the browser is redirected to a `somtoday://` address that Home Assistant cannot receive. Copy it from the address bar, or open Chrome DevTools → Network, find the callback request and copy its `Location:` header value. Paste the redirect URL (or just the code) below.

reauth_confirm.description:
Open this URL in your browser and log in again:

{auth_url}

Then paste the resulting redirect URL (or just the code) below. Tip: in Chrome DevTools → Network you can copy the `Location:` header of the callback request.
